   "id": "e1",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      45.0,
      58.68,
      265.68,
      69.48
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Poorinda Royal Mantle\u2019 is entirely dark green suffused"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      44.64,
      69.12,
      273.6,
      80.28
     ],
     "text": "with dark red corresponding to RHS 187A. As the foliage"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      45.0,
      79.56,
      253.44,
      88.92
     ],
     "text": "matures, the red colours disappear in both varieties."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      44.64,
      89.28,
      277.2,
      99.36
     ],
     "text": "Mature foliage is light green and variegated in \u2018Sunkissed"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.92,
      99.36,
      253.08,
      111.6
     ],
     "text": "Waters\u2019 but uniformly dark green in \u2018Poorinda Royal"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.92,
      109.44,
      255.24,
      119.16
     ],
     "text": "Mantle\u2019. The leaves of both are broadly lanceolate to"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      44.28,
      119.52,
      255.6,
      129.6
     ],
     "text": "elliptic, with deeply lobed margins on fully-expanded"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      44.28,
      129.24,
      278.64,
      138.6
     ],
     "text": "leaves. \u2018Sunkissed Waters\u2019 has shorter leaves and is more"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.56,
      139.32,
      203.04,
      148.68
     ],
     "text": "branched than \u2018Poorinda Royal Mantle\u2019."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Poorinda Royal Mantle\u2019 is entirely dark green suffused\nwith dark red corresponding to RHS 187A. As the foliage\nmatures, the red colours disappear in both varieties.\nMature foliage is light green and variegated in \u2018Sunkissed\nWaters\u2019 but uniformly dark green in \u2018Poorinda Royal\nMantle\u2019. The leaves of both are broadly lanceolate to\nelliptic, with deeply lobed margins on fully-expanded\nleaves. \u2018Sunkissed Waters\u2019 has shorter leaves and is more\nbranched than \u2018Poorinda Royal Mantle\u2019.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
