     "bbox": [
      311.04,
      62.28,
      336.24,
      70.92
     ],
     "text": "Origin"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.04,
      72.72,
      516.24,
      82.44
     ],
     "text": "This variety arose from the controlled pollination of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.4,
      82.8,
      538.92,
      93.24
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Alexander\u2019 by \u2018Silver Jubilee'in 1979. This seedling was"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      310.68,
      92.88,
      514.08,
      101.16
     ],
     "text": "selected on the basis of its colour. \u2018Remember Me\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      310.32,
      102.6,
      546.12,
      112.68
     ],
     "text": "(Cocdestin) has been protected by Plant Breeders Rights in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      310.68,
      112.68,
      371.52,
      119.52
     ],
     "text": "UK since 1984."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Origin\nThis variety arose from the controlled pollination of\n\u2018Alexander\u2019 by \u2018Silver Jubilee'in 1979. This seedling was\nselected on the basis of its colour. \u2018Remember Me\u2019\n(Cocdestin) has been protected by Plant Breeders Rights in\nUK since 1984.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    309.6,
    136.08,
    542.16,
    194.04
   ],
   "id": "e10",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      310.68,
      136.08,
      466.92,
      145.08
     ],
     "text": "Morphology \u2014 see comparison tables."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      310.32,
      145.8,
      534.24,
      155.88
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) is a russet flowered upright"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.96,
      155.88,
      527.04,
      164.88
     ],
     "text": "shrub rose which differs from \u2018Royal Dane\u2019 and \u2018Anne"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.6,
      165.96,
      542.16,
      175.32
     ],
     "text": "Marie Treschlin\u2019 in having lighter coloured petals, smaller"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.96,
      175.68,
      527.04,
      183.6
     ],
     "text": "flowers and narrower terminal leaflets in ratio to their"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.96,
      185.76,
      336.24,
      194.04
     ],
     "text": "tength."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Morphology \u2014 see comparison tables.\n\u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) is a russet flowered upright\nshrub rose which differs from \u2018Royal Dane\u2019 and \u2018Anne\nMarie Treschlin\u2019 in having lighter coloured petals, smaller\nflowers and narrower terminal leaflets in ratio to their\ntength.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    308.88,
    210.24,
    535.68,
    268.2
   ],
   "id": "e11",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.6,
      210.24,
      523.08,
      218.52
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) is a midseason rose with"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.24,
      220.32,
      523.8,
      228.96
     ],
     "text": "glossy medium green foliage as is \u2018Royal Dane\u2019 while"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.6,
      230.04,
      535.68,
      239.4
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Anne Marie Treschlin\u2019 is an early flowering variety with"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      308.88,
      240.48,
      532.44,
      249.12
     ],
     "text": "dull dark green foliage. \u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.6,
      250.2,
      533.52,
      258.48
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Anne Marie Treschlin\u2019 both have yellow stamens while"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      309.24,
      260.28,
      444.96,
      268.2
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Royal Dane\u2019 has bronze stamens."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) is a midseason rose with\nglossy medium green foliage as is \u2018Royal Dane\u2019 while\n\u2018Anne Marie Treschlin\u2019 is an early flowering variety with\ndull dark green foliage. \u2018Remember Me\u2019 (Cocdestin) and\n\u2018Anne Marie Treschlin\u2019 both have yellow stamens while\n\u2018Royal Dane\u2019 has bronze stamens.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
